      zoo:identifier 2 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/1/55> ;
      zoo:text "Those picked with bare fingers are better than those picked with gloves, as the hard gloves not only bruise the berry but also tear the bark from the branches and leave them exposed to the frost." .

