      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/3/5> ;
      zoo:text "4 Do you see anywhere here citrus wood or gold, or vermilion or azure, or any coloured" .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/3/2/text/15>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 15 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/3/2> ;
      zoo:text "67 Ursinus would read esse id insigne nuptiarum . A scene in the Acharnians of Aristophanes is based on the pun, especially 758‑759." .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/3/12/text/8>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 8 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/3/12> ;
      zoo:text "6 While the geese are sitting they should be fed on barley soaked in water. The goslings are fed first on barley-meal or barley for two days, and for the next three on green cress cut fine, soaked in water and turned into a vessel. But after they are shut into the coops or the under ­ground nests, twenty to the nest, as I have said,⁠79 they are fed on ground" .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/251>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 251 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4> ;
      zoo:text "100 We do not know the author; but Aristophanes ( Eccles. 974) calls a girl μέλιττα Μοῦσης, ' honey-bee of the Muse.' The reason given here is their response to the music of the cymbals, of the rhythmical beating of the hands. ❦" .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/142>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 142 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4> ;
      zoo:text "97 Vervactum is called by Columella, II .10.5 and elsewhere, veteretum . The word means soil which has been broken ( vervago ) and allowed to lie fallow. ❦" .

<http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4/text/275>
      a       zoo:Paragraph ;
      zoo:identifier 275 ;
      zoo:isPartOf <http://ns.inria.fr/zoomathia/VARRO/de_re_rustica/e/4> ;
